  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Boil the kettle.\n• Roughly chop capsicum into bite-sized chunks. Thinly slice carrot into half-moons. Grate zucchini.\n• Half-fill a large saucepan with the boiling water. Add fusilli and a pinch of salt. Cook over high heat until 'al dente', 11 mins.\n• Reserve some pasta water (1/2 cup for 2P / 1 cup for 4P) then drain and return to pan.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6927a09ad4fb034401632700/step-841ab400.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, in a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over high heat.\n• Cook carrot and capsicum until tender, 4-5 mins. Add zucchini and cook until tender, 2-3 mins.\n• Reduce heat to medium, add Nan’s special seasoning and garlic & herb spice blend, and cook until fragrant, 1 min.\n• Stir in light cooking cream, reserved pasta water and the butter and cook, until bubbling, 2-3 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6927a09ad4fb034401632700/step-827ce010.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Preheat grill to high.\n• Remove pan from heat and stir through cooked fusilli, until combined. Season with pepper.\n• Transfer pasta mixture to the baking dish. Sprinkle with Cheddar cheese. Grill until golden, 8-10 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6927a09ad4fb034401632700/step-ba80b920.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Divide cheesy veggie pasta bake between bowls. Sprinkle with chilli flakes (if using).",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6927a09ad4fb034401632700/step-cf7c7b30.jpeg"
    }
  ]
